# The build runs in a Linux container that reads this working tree through a
# bind mount, so every text file keeps LF endings whatever the platform it is
# checked out on. A CR at the end of a line breaks things, and not always
# loudly: the shebang of a script ("bad interpreter"), a recipe in a Makefile,
# a linker script, a gcc specs file.
* text=auto eol=lf
